Package: opencodemeva-patch
Version: 2.2.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, python3
Maintainer: kuldeep7ke
Description: OpenCode Meva style patch for opencode config
  Installs the Opencode Patch pack (agents, skills, commands, rules,
  hooks, mcp-configs, workflows, plugins) into the user's opencode config
  directory (~/.config/opencode) as a removable, unapply-capable patch.
  The pack files live under /opt/opencodemeva/pack and the opencodemeva-patch
  tool applies them for the invoking user. Run 'opencodemeva-patch --unapply'
  to remove the patch again.
